          "char_hao_ji_liu",
          "fac_yan_tribe",
          "char_yan_tian_ji",
          "char_yan_cui_er",
          "sys_storage_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Yan Tian Ji cooperates so Hao Ji Liu can refine the Gu, which still holds Yan Tian Ji’s will at that moment.",
        "chapters": [
          470
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "transfer-at-the-lake",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After escaping the ambush that follows, Hao Ji Liu treats obtaining backwater battle Gu as the success of the trip.",
